%%{init: {"theme":"default","securityLevel":"loose"} }%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Passenger
    participant ReactUI as React TypeScript Web UI
    participant TrainSearchAPI as Train Search API
    participant BookingAPI as Booking API
    participant PaymentAPI as Payment API
    participant PaymentGateway as Payment Gateway
    participant NotificationAPI as Notification API
    participant NotificationProvider as Email/SMS Provider
    participant RailwayDB as Azure SQL Database
    Passenger->>ReactUI: Enter source, destination, date
    ReactUI->>TrainSearchAPI: GET /api/trains/search
    TrainSearchAPI->>RailwayDB: Query trains, schedules, fares
    RailwayDB-->>TrainSearchAPI: Matching trains
    TrainSearchAPI-->>ReactUI: Trains with seat availability by class
    Passenger->>ReactUI: Select train and enter passenger details
    ReactUI->>BookingAPI: POST /api/bookings
    BookingAPI->>RailwayDB: Reserve seats and create booking reference
    RailwayDB-->>BookingAPI: Booking reference
    BookingAPI-->>ReactUI: Booking pending payment
    ReactUI->>PaymentAPI: POST /api/payments
    PaymentAPI->>PaymentGateway: Authorize payment
    PaymentGateway-->>PaymentAPI: Payment result
    alt Payment successful
        PaymentAPI->>RailwayDB: Confirm booking and issue ticket
        PaymentAPI->>NotificationAPI: Trigger booking confirmation
        NotificationAPI->>NotificationProvider: Send email and SMS
        PaymentAPI-->>ReactUI: Ticket confirmed
    else Payment failed
        PaymentAPI->>RailwayDB: Release seats, keep booking unconfirmed
        PaymentAPI-->>ReactUI: Payment failed, no confirmed ticket
    end